{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "给予后果夹带恩典", "content": "在管教孩子时，可以给予后果后告知后果，允许孩子选择，并在给予后果时夹带恩典，帮助孩子思考如果还有一次机会会怎么做。有时可以给予恩典让孩子继续玩，但如果孩子已经多次重复问题，则不再给予恩典。", "steps": ["给予后果", "告知后果", "允许选择", "夹带恩典", "帮助孩子思考如果还有一次机会会怎么做"], "conditions": ["孩子已经多次重复问题时不给予恩典"], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["管教", "后果", "恩典"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a001", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3", "blocks": ["b00001"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a019", "kind": "supports", "condition": "管教方法", "reason": "给予后果夹带恩典的方法中，帮助孩子思考如果还有一次机会会怎么做，与找出解决问题的方法类似。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "legacy:nl-c-12", "kind": "equivalent", "condition": "共同适用：给予后果时夹带恩典；旧库归入3-7岁，新库未限定年龄。", "reason": "两者均涉及后果、选择、恩典，并提及孩子重复问题时不再给予恩典。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:u001"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "8-12岁父母感到失去控制", "content": "8-12岁孩子的父母开始感到失去控制，因为孩子越来越倾向于更明显的矛盾，更像成人的矛盾。父母感到失去控制后变得非常焦虑，特别是自己情绪上没有处理好的父母。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["8-12岁", "失去控制", "焦虑"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a002", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3", "blocks": ["b00002"], "source_kind": "A1"}, {"source_id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3", "blocks": ["b00002", "b00003"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a003", "kind": "association", "condition": "8-12岁阶段", "reason": "“8-12岁父母感到失去控制并焦虑”与“8-12岁父母不知如何处理矛盾是更大的困难”同属该阶段父母的困难，但因果证据不足，改为关联。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "原因果不充分，改为关联。"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:u002"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "父母不知如何处理矛盾成为困难", "content": "8-12岁阶段，父母自己不知道如何处理矛盾是更大的困难。如果父母没有很好的智慧来处理矛盾，孩子的矛盾对父母来讲是一种威胁。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["矛盾处理", "父母困难"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a003", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3", "blocks": ["b00002", "b00003"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:u003"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "advice", "title": "趁孩子不大处理自己的问题", "content": "父母应趁孩子还小赶紧处理自己的问题，包括原生家庭问题和心理情绪问题，因为处理好后，孩子大一点时更知道如何应对孩子。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["父母成长", "原生家庭", "情绪处理"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a004", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3", "blocks": ["b00003", "b00004"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a003", "kind": "supports", "condition": "父母提前处理自身问题", "reason": "父母处理好自己的问题后，更知道如何应对孩子，从而减少处理矛盾的困难。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:u004"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "11-12岁孩子开始与父母疏远", "content": "孩子在后期十一二岁时慢慢开始与父母疏远，例如以前送孩子去学校会亲一个，但突然到十岁十一岁时孩子就不亲了，从此以后没有再亲过。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["疏远", "亲子关系", "11-12岁"], "evidence": "reported_case", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a005", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3", "blocks": ["b00004", "b00005"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:u005"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "anti-pattern", "subtype": "counterexample", "title": "8-12岁父母常用语言暴力", "content": "8-12岁阶段，父母常用的矛盾处理方法中语言暴力出现，八岁九岁有些家庭还有身体暴力，但更多是语言暴力。父母不打孩子后，开始讽刺孩子，让孩子觉得自己很不堪、很糟糕，以发泄愤怒。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["界限"], "tags": ["语言暴力", "讽刺", "愤怒发泄"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": ["语言暴力和身体暴力对儿童有害，应避免使用"], "id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a006", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3", "blocks": ["b00005", "b00006"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a008", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "语言暴力", "reason": "“8-12岁父母常用语言暴力”与“案例中父母曾讲‘你怎么不去死’等语言暴力，孩子后来寻死”构成实例关系。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": "案例是语言暴力行为的实例。"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:u006"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "anti-pattern", "subtype": "counterexample", "title": "行为威胁及其后果", "content": "8-12岁阶段，父母常用行为威胁处理矛盾，如收东西、收手机、不给零花钱、赶出去等。如果父母行为威胁孩子，到13-18岁阶段，孩子会反过去做那些父母曾经威胁的事情，例如父母曾威胁赶走孩子，孩子进入下一阶段后可能一有矛盾就离家出走。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["界限"], "tags": ["行为威胁", "后果", "13-18岁"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": ["行为威胁可能对儿童造成心理伤害，应避免使用"], "id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a007", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3", "blocks": ["b00007"], "source_kind": "A1"}, {"source_id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3", "blocks": ["b00007", "b00008"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a008", "kind": "association", "condition": "行为威胁", "reason": "“8-12岁父母常用行为威胁，孩子可能反做被威胁的事”与“案例中父母威胁‘你怎么不去死’，孩子后来寻死”虽相关，但目标案例为语言暴力而非行为威胁，不能直接支持源命题，改为关联。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "威胁类型不同，支持力度不足。"}, {"target": "legacy:nl-ca-05", "kind": "complements", "condition": "补充概念：行为威胁及其后果；解释父母威胁行为导致孩子以后重复该行为", "reason": "提供一般性原理：父母行为威胁孩子，孩子进入下一阶段后可能去做父母曾威胁的事，补充了旧知识未展开的机制。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:u007"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "case", "subtype": "case", "title": "父母威胁赶走导致孩子离家出走", "content": "案例：一个15岁孩子，父母在他小时候经常讲“我为什么要生你，你怎么不去死”，父母自己情绪有很大问题。后来孩子三番五次寻死，因为矛盾太深刻刻在记忆中，孩子会做当初父母讲的事情。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": ["案例为个案，不能代表全天下的孩子"], "modules": ["界限"], "tags": ["语言暴力", "自杀风险", "案例"], "evidence": "reported_case", "risk_flags": ["案例涉及自杀风险，需专业干预", "父母语言暴力对儿童有严重负面影响"], "id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a008", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3", "blocks": ["b00008", "b00009", "b00010"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "legacy:nl-ca-05", "kind": "equivalent", "condition": "共同适用：父母从小用语言暴力（怎么不去死）；孩子长大后反复寻死", "reason": "候选案例与旧知识描述同一案例，内容一致：父母常骂孩子怎么不去死，后来孩子三番五次寻死。候选还提到父母情绪问题，但核心事实及解释（孩子复刻父母语言）一致。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:u008"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "告知孩子生理变化", "content": "在8-12岁阶段，父母应清清楚楚告知孩子生理上的变化，如荷尔蒙变化和身体各方面变化，让孩子心理情绪上不恐惧。因为孩子刚开始发育时会害怕陌生的东西，可能不喜欢自己，不知道自己怎么了。", "steps": ["告知孩子生理变化", "解释荷尔蒙变化", "解释身体各方面变化"], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["生理变化", "荷尔蒙", "恐惧"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a009", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3", "blocks": ["b00010", "b00011"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a010", "kind": "causes", "condition": "生理变化", "reason": "生理变化导致情绪波动，孩子因此产生自我矛盾。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:u009"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "孩子情绪波动与自我矛盾", "content": "8-12岁孩子经常说“我也不知道怎么了，我突然就很生气/难过”，因为生理变化导致情绪波动，孩子可能很不喜欢自己，不喜欢自己的变化和经历。父母需要帮助孩子处理自己和自己的矛盾。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["情绪波动", "自我矛盾", "生理变化"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a010", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3", "blocks": ["b00011", "b00012"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:u010"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "前额叶未发育成熟导致冲动", "content": "孩子有矛盾时，前额叶处理矛盾，但前额叶没有长好，所以孩子容易冲动地处理矛盾。因此需要教导孩子如何处理矛盾。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["前额叶", "冲动", "大脑发育"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a011", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3", "blocks": ["b00012", "b00013"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:r001", "kind": "prerequisite", "condition": "前额叶未发育成熟", "reason": "因为前额叶未发育成熟，孩子容易冲动，所以需要教导孩子处理矛盾的方法。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "legacy:nl-r-03", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用：孩子因前额叶发育未成熟而冲动处理矛盾；旧原子聚焦12–19岁，候选未限定年龄", "reason": "候选说明孩子有矛盾时前额叶未长好所以容易冲动，补充旧原子中冲动与矛盾处理的关系。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}, {"target": "legacy:nl-r-05", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用：孩子因前额叶未成熟冲动处理矛盾；旧原子按年龄设定处理方式", "reason": "候选解释孩子有矛盾时前额叶未长好所以容易冲动，支持旧原子因年龄不同需不同处理。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:u011"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "教孩子数到十冷静", "content": "教孩子处理矛盾的第一步：当情绪激动时，先数到十，养成习惯，不管情绪多么激动，在进行下一个行为或反映情绪的行为之前先数到十，让孩子快速冷静下来。父母自己也要这么做。", "steps": ["情绪激动时", "先数到十", "再进行下一个行为"], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["冷静", "数到十", "情绪管理"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a012", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3", "blocks": ["b00013", "b00014"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a013", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "矛盾处理四步法", "reason": "数到十冷静是第一步，陈述情绪并理解问题是第二步。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:u012"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "教孩子陈述情绪并理解问题", "content": "教孩子处理矛盾的第二步：教孩子陈述情绪，并理解问题是什么。这个阶段孩子有两个问题：无法表述自己的情绪，无法理解情绪背后根本的问题。", "steps": ["教孩子陈述情绪", "帮助孩子理解情绪背后的根本问题"], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["情绪表达", "问题理解"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a013", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3", "blocks": ["b00014", "b00015"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a016", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "矛盾处理四步法", "reason": "陈述情绪并理解问题是第二步，认真道歉是第三步。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:u013"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "case", "subtype": "case", "title": "孩子因被问分数而爆发", "content": "案例：孩子回家后，父母习惯性问“今天考试考了多少分”，孩子突然爆发，说“你不要问这个东西，你为什么每天只管我的分数，你从来不真正的管我”。父母觉得莫名其妙，但事实上孩子可能在学校被孤立或感到挫败，情绪被引爆。孩子爆发后也感到后悔。真正问题是孩子有情绪（如孤单），但不知道背后是因为情绪需求没有得到满足。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["情绪爆发", "分数", "情绪需求"], "evidence": "hypothetical", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a014", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3", "blocks": ["b00015", "b00016", "b00017"], "source_kind": "A1"}, {"source_id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3", "blocks": ["b00015", "b00016", "b00017", "b00018"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a013", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "情绪爆发", "reason": "“孩子因被问分数爆发，无法表述情绪与理解根本问题”是“教孩子陈述情绪并理解问题”的具体实例。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": "案例体现概念所述问题。"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:u014"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "帮助孩子梳理矛盾过程", "content": "当孩子大脑有矛盾时，帮助孩子整理矛盾：一步一步带孩子梳理，理解问题的核心，反推回去问题的核心出在哪里。过程包括：矛盾怎么开始的，从哪一步起源，到哪一步激化，到哪一步无法忍受，到哪一步崩溃。", "steps": ["帮助孩子梳理矛盾过程", "从矛盾起源开始", "找出激化点", "找出无法忍受点", "找出崩溃点", "反推问题核心"], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["矛盾梳理", "问题核心", "情绪管理"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a015", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3", "blocks": ["b00018", "b00019"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a013", "kind": "supports", "condition": "理解问题", "reason": "帮助孩子梳理矛盾过程有助于理解问题，是陈述情绪并理解问题步骤的深化。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:u015"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "教孩子认真道歉", "content": "教孩子处理矛盾的第三步：教孩子认真道歉，父母自己也要学习认真和孩子道歉。对于不大不小的事情，可以用3R方式道歉。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["道歉", "3R"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a016", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3", "blocks": ["b00019", "b00020"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a019", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "矛盾处理四步法", "reason": "认真道歉是第三步，找出解决问题的方法是第四步。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:u016"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "3R道歉法", "content": "3R道歉法：第一R是Regret（后悔），表达后悔的情绪和感受，如“妈妈很后悔今天对你说了这个话，我觉得我这样讲是错的、不对的、不负责任的”。第二R是Remedy（补救），说明可以怎样补救做错的事情。第三R是Responsibility（负责任），表示会对造成的伤害负责任。", "steps": ["Regret：表达后悔", "Remedy：提出补救", "Responsibility：承担责任"], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["道歉", "3R", "后悔", "补救", "责任"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a017", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3", "blocks": ["b00020", "b00021"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a018", "kind": "supports", "condition": "3R道歉法", "reason": "a017详细说明3R道歉法，a018说明孩子道歉的要求，两者一致。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:u017"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "孩子道歉的要求", "content": "孩子道歉时：首先必须承认后悔，如果不后悔就不应该道歉；第二，必须学会补救，不是说sorry就够了，需要真真正正补救错误，如摔坏东西要赔钱；第三，孩子需要对自己的话语和造成的伤害负责任。", "steps": ["承认后悔", "补救错误", "负责任"], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["道歉", "补救", "责任"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a018", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3", "blocks": ["b00022", "b00023"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:u018"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
