{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "教孩子处理矛盾的完整四步法", "content": "教孩子处理矛盾包括四个步骤：第一，情绪激动时先数到十冷静；第二，教孩子陈述情绪并理解问题；第三，教孩子认真道歉（父母也要学习认真道歉）；第四，找出解决问题的方法。", "steps": ["数到十冷静", "陈述情绪并理解问题", "认真道歉", "找出解决问题的方法"], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["矛盾处理", "四步法"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:r001", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-7f7fb7be02b3", "blocks": ["b00013", "b00014", "b00015", "b00019", "b00023", "b00024"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a012", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a013", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a016", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:a019", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "legacy:nl-c-12", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用：教孩子处理矛盾；旧库针对8-12岁列出数到十、陈述情绪、3R道歉，新库四步法未指定年龄。", "reason": "新库补充了完整四步法（数到十、陈述情绪、认真道歉、找解决方法），覆盖且细化了旧库8-12岁的方法。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-7f7fb7be02b3-c001:u020"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
